[{"id":1256643361420668928,"date":1588442099000,"rawContent":"A thread about being led by the nose:\nWhen #BlackLivesMatter was at a peak, we started to see an increase in pushback about people killing police. It happened right before the 2016 election. Every single story that came out, there was an attempt to place the blame on BLM.","userId":57039392,"media":null,"username":"aliciagarza","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":76,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":11,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1256643371239538688,"date":1588442101000,"rawContent":"Laying this whole thing at the feet of #MeToo and other related entities looks the same as asking #BlackLivesMatter to answer for police being killed or black people killing other black people. I think it\u2019s meant to discredit the legitimacy of those movements.","userId":57039392,"media":null,"username":"aliciagarza","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":77,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":12,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1256643372288114688,"date":1588442101000,"rawContent":"It\u2019s intended as a \u201cgotcha!\u201d moment. But gotcha around what, exactly? What is the end goal of laying this at the feet of #MeToo? If this movement doesn\u2019t have the simple easy answer for you about what to do here, then what?","userId":57039392,"media":null,"username":"aliciagarza","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":77,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":13,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1256643370031542274,"date":1588442101000,"rawContent":"#MeToo is not responsible for being the arbiter of every story of sexual violence. That\u2019s not the point of #MeToo and it\u2019s not why it was created. But these comparisons to the uproar around Kavanaugh don\u2019t smell right to me.","userId":57039392,"media":null,"username":"aliciagarza","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":77,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":14,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1256643374452334593,"date":1588442102000,"rawContent":"The story y\u2019all told wasn\u2019t yours \u2014 it was theirs. Now they get to say \u201cSEE? That #MeToo movement ain\u2019t about shit. They\u2019re politically motivated, and only care about sexual violence when it\u2019s our people being accused.\u201d","userId":57039392,"media":null,"username":"aliciagarza","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":77,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":15,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1256643375651934208,"date":1588442102000,"rawContent":"It sounds a lot like \u201cSEE? That #BlackLivesMatter stuff is all false. They encourage people to kill police.\u201d Enter false outrage and grandstanding \u2014 and a story that sticks.","userId":57039392,"media":null,"username":"aliciagarza","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":